<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">09062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Four Lebanese Red Cross paramedics were killed by an Israeli airstrike south of Tyre, among seven dead, including a child, according to Lebanon's health ministry.</s> <s>Medics are a protected category under the laws of war, yet strikes on rescue workers are escalating even as no ceasefire talks are scheduled.</s> <s>Lebanon has no air defense to answer the planes overhead, and Iran has made the country a condition of any wider deal with Washington.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran declared the Strait of Hormuz an Iran-Oman matter alone, ruling out any American or European role in the world's most critical oil passage.</s> <s>Adviser Mohsen Rezaei said thirty ships transit daily, accusing Washington of blocking vessels from pre-approved routes.</s> <s>Tehran's converting wartime control of the chokepoint into a permanent claim of sovereignty — and Oman hasn't confirmed the framing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India opened the Zojila tunnel, a thirteen-kilometre year-round link between the Kashmir Valley and the high desert of Ladakh.</s> <s>The road bypasses a pass above eleven thousand feet that snow seals for half the year, guaranteeing military resupply toward the Chinese and Pakistani frontiers.</s> <s>Until a second tunnel opens at Shinku La, this single route carries all of winter's military traffic.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American and Nigerian forces claimed one hundred seventy-five Islamic State West Africa fighters were killed in Borno state in May.</s> <s>Villagers in Metele tell a different story — that the dead were farmers, herders, and children, and that a remote air war outsources verification to the very forces doing the killing.</s> <s>No independent monitor has reached the area to contest the count.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>More than thirteen thousand people fled South Darfur's Kubum locality in just three days, the International Organization for Migration reported.</s> <s>This is the third eruption of fighting between the Beni Halba and Salamat since Sudan's war began in twenty twenty-three, and three successive ceasefires have already collapsed.</s> <s>Each broken truce uproots families who'd only just stopped running.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Otoniel received thirty years in a Colombian court, yet the Gulf Clan he once led is larger and richer today than when he ran it.</s> <s>Decapitation removes a name and leaves the machine — the cartel is a franchise, not a person, and its territory, routes, and revenue survived his arrest intact.</s> <s>A successor known as Chiquito Malo now commands Colombia's largest criminal group, with no extradition pending.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Millions of South Asian and African workers who built the Gulf's gleaming cities have no shelters and no evacuation flights as missiles cross the region.</s> <s>Kafala visa rules restrict their departure, and the states that sent them lack the leverage to compel a single plane out.</s> <s>Not one Gulf government has published an evacuation framework for its low-income labour.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Trade between Russia and China climbed nearly twenty-three percent to one hundred nine and a half billion dollars in the first five months of the year, per Chinese customs.</s> <s>Sanctions meant to isolate Moscow have instead deepened a parallel settlement system, with Chinese exports of cars, machinery, and electronics up more than a quarter.</s> <s>Whether the pace holds will measure how far dollar sanctions have pushed two economies into each other's arms.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's Karachi exchange fell more than fifteen hundred points, slipping below one hundred seventy thousand for the first time since late May.</s> <s>The country routes nearly all its oil through the Gulf, so a Hormuz scare prices straight into Karachi equities before a single barrel is actually disrupted.</s> <s>The market, in other words, is pricing the chokepoint, not the war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Switzerland will hold a binding referendum to cap its population at ten million people.</s> <s>Federal data show one in three workers is foreign-born, so a yes vote would force parliament to curb the very immigration that powers its high-wage economy.</s> <s>Officials warn the cap would collide head-on with the country's bilateral treaties with the European Union.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canada banned cattle imports from Texas after the flesh-eating screwworm reappeared across Texas and New Mexico.</s> <s>To eradicate the parasite, American authorities must scale sterile-fly releases from eight million to four hundred million every week — a fiftyfold jump.</s> <s>Canada had already imported more than half a million American cattle this year, and the border may now stay closed.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Koalas suffered a severe population crash around one hundred thousand years ago, long before humans ever reached Australia.</s> <s>A genomic study found the species already genetically depleted before any human contact, carrying far less diversity to absorb today's fires, drought, and disease.</s> <s>Conservation built on the idea of a pristine pre-human baseline may rest on a false assumption.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>NASA satellites revealed that aquifers are falling beneath Brazil, one of the world's largest food exporters.</s> <s>The measurements make previously invisible groundwater drawdowns visible for the first time, beneath farmland that helps feed much of the planet.</s> <s>No extraction limits exist for the affected aquifers, and Brazil is only beginning to reckon with the loss.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers say reformulated cattle feed can cut methane while raising yields — a rare climate lever that asks no farmer to shrink a herd.</s> <s>Feed additives alter the gut fermentation that is cattle's largest climate output, lifting productivity at the very same time.</s> <s>Field trials are underway across sub-Saharan Africa and South Asia, though no commercial product exists yet.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The American regulator waived its rule requiring Amazon to launch half its Leo broadband network by July, a deadline the company was set to badly miss.</s> <s>Amazon has lofted three hundred thirty-three of more than three thousand planned satellites, and both its heavy-lift rockets sit grounded with no launch date.</s> <s>That milestone existed precisely to stop license-holders from hoarding scarce orbital spectrum they aren't yet using.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A software engineer's account of code-generating models hollowing out junior and mid-level work drew over a thousand comments, a measure of how acute the anxiety has grown.</s> <s>The real danger isn't the dramatic layoff but the quiet erosion of the rungs juniors once climbed to become seniors.</s> <s>Break that ladder, and you lose the very people trained to one day supervise the machines.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>